[node name="basic_shield" type="Node"]
script = ExtResource("1_7uk2p")
title = "Radiation Shield"
price = 79
description = "Step into the future of space travel with cutting-edge spatial shielding technology. Designed to safeguard your spacecraft from the unpredictable dangers of deep space, our shield offers seamless protection against micrometeoroids, radiation bursts, and debris.Experience enhanced safety with an adaptive energy barrier that responds in real-time to threats, maintaining optimal performance while minimizing power consumption. Lightweight and fully integrated, the Spatial Shield lets you focus on exploration, not defense."
video = ExtResource("2_wjqgk")
unique_name = "radiation_shield"
legal_text = "[center][b][color=#B48EAD]Radiation Shield™ Limited Assurance and Acknowledgement Clause (LAAC)[/color][/b][/center]

By possessing, wearing, displaying, admiring, or merely being within the general conceptual vicinity of the [b]Radiation Shield™[/b] (hereinafter \"The Shield\"), the user (hereinafter \"The Believer\") acknowledges the following:

The Shield is [b]certified by no recognized authority[/b] to offer [i]passive metaphysical resistance[/i] against:
• 5G, 6G, 7G and speculative pre-quantum waveforms  
• Cosmic microwave background radiation and rogue neutrino storms  
• Government-issued thought patterns and/or [i]Reptilian neuro-manipulation[/i]  
• Unspecified energies, vibes, or atmospheres deemed \"inauspicious\"

While The Shield has been [color=#A3BE8C]enthusiastically endorsed[/color] in certain online forums, kitchen-table studies, and visionary dream sequences, it provides [b]no measurable, implied, or observable protection[/b] against [b]anything[/b].

[i]Any shielding effect is strictly coincidental and may be psychosomatic, placebo-based, or retroactively imagined.[/i]

[b]Use of The Shield constitutes:[/b]
• Tacit and irreversible acceptance of the notion that [i]you are already protected[/i]  
• Acceptance regardless of external circumstances, internal doubts, or objective reality

[quote][i]✨ For entertainment purposes only. Not a medical device. Not a scientific device. Not a device.[/i][/quote]

Prolonged use may result in:
• Heightened self-assurance  
• Conspiratorial confidence  
• The [i]illusion of empowerment[/i]

This product makes [b]no claims[/b] other than the ones just stated, and [b]disclaims those as well[/b]."
